OL,3,AAged 16-24 and looking for work? Use
OL,4,Aour look-up to find out which areas
OL,5,Ahave the most jobs
OL,6,
OL,7,FIf you're one of the nearly one million
OL,8,Fpeople aged 16-24 not in education,
OL,9,Femployment or training - otherwise
OL,10,Fknown as "Neet" - then you might be
OL,11,Fwondering where to start.
OL,13,FUnder-25s should be guaranteed job
OL,14,Fplacements or training to help them
OL,15,Ffind permanent work, a major review
OL,16,Faimed at cutting the number of Neets
OL,17,Fwill say.
OL,19,FBut how many jobs are there where you
OL,20,Flive and in which sectors are you most
OL,21,Flikely to find an opening?
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
