OL,3,AAged 16-24 and looking for work? Use
OL,4,Aour look-up to find out which areas
OL,5,Ahave the most jobs
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is no official measure of how
OL,8,Fmany vacancies are suitable for young
OL,9,Fpeople, but across the whole economy
OL,10,Fthere were 691,000 jobs available in
OL,11,Fthe July to September period this year,
OL,12,Fwhich is the lowest number since early
OL,13,F2021.
